  openingPrompt: Press play and listen to the choir in this place. As you listen,
    notice how the voices shape the space.
  contextSteps:
  - Choral voices turn a large room into a shared acoustic space.
  - In Christian worship, singing carries hymns and prayers and helps shape the rhythm
    of a service.
  - Singing together can make a service feel communal, with familiar melodies passed
    between generations.
  - For an individual, a hymn or a familiar voice can hold memories of family, worship
    and belonging.
