  m_text: "Located in Cathedral Square, the Citizens\u2019 War Memorial hosted annual
    ANZAC services until the 2011 earthquake. It has witnessed the changing landscape
    of Christchurch Cathedral.\nSusan, a local Christchurch resident, recalls a school
    trip to Cathedral Square. The Cathedral\u2019s tower and spire have remained
    special landmarks in her memories..."
